{
  "start_here": "Say to your AI: \"Propose the task Book the offsite from meeting standup, then approve it, then show me my calendar tasks.\" Your AI keeps the proposal and the task in your own store with workflow:keep-my-calendar-tasks-and-proposals, then reads them back with tool:answer-the-calendar-page-route (GET /calendar/tasks and GET /calendar/task-proposals).",
